Add public/setup.php, a one-time first-Owner creator for the shell-less host.
Same fail-closed 404 guard shape as public/migrate.php: 404 when SETUP_TOKEN is
unset or wrong, CSRF checked on the POST, creates the first Owner only when no
staff user exists and refuses once one does. Document SETUP_TOKEN and the login
and password tunables in .env.example.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WtPSCHa384VpAoViRVU3Z7
